      "message": "This should instead be moved into a dedicated repository under the arm-firmware-crates namespace. arm-gic has very similar macros for the CPU interface registers and other projects like rust-spmc would also benefit from a separate sysregs crate.\nWhat\u0027s the reason for not moving the actual register definitions into arm-sysregs?",
